---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`About Us — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Two people in midlife who refused the default outcome and built a protocol, a practice, and a relationship around that refusal."
>
  <section class="page-hero on-dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="label">About Us</div>
      <h1>We are the experiment.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="lead">We are Todd and Jenn. Married, in midlife, and running our own research experiment on what actually works.</p>
      <p>We refuse the story we were sold: that midlife means less. We don't intend to give up the things that make life good. We certainly don't plan on losing strength, energy, or focus. And we don't accept that declining as you age is the default.</p>
      <p>We're doing it together. Two people sharing information, holding each other accountable, and providing what matters most in this phase of life: support.</p>
      <p class="pull-quote">His stack and her stack.<br />Different bodies, different needs, different seasons.<br />One shared goal: live midlife on our own terms.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="voices on-dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow-rule"><span class="label">Why we started</span></div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <article class="voice">
          <h2>Todd</h2>
          <p>Midlife doesn't mean giving in to aging. With the right stack: peptides, movement, fuel, and mindset, your body can absolutely get better with age. There's a pathway, and that's why we started The Stacked Couple.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="voice">
          <h2>Jenn</h2>
          <p>I was a D1 collegiate athlete. Multiple surgeries later, my body is still paying the price. Then came cancer, and genetic testing that showed variants predisposing me to inflammation and autoimmune issues. Genetically the odds were stacked against me.</p>
          <p>If the right stack tips those odds back in my favor, I want to share what I find. Especially with women, who are underserved by almost everything published about peptides and optimization. The research rarely gets translated for a female body.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="eyebrow-rule"><span class="label">Why now</span></div>
      <p>We're watching our parents struggle. We have a front row seat to what twenty years from now looks like if we don't stay strong and active.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="eyebrow-rule"><span class="label">What this is</span></div>
      <p>This is a real-life experiment. Two people using the latest research and science to support healthy aging and live midlife on our own terms.</p>
      <p>Honest conversations about what we're researching, what we're running, and what we've learned along the way. Four stacks: Optimization, Movement, Fuel, Mind.</p>
      <p>We're not clinicians. Nothing here is a prescription, and your stack won't look like ours.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:clamp(64px,9vw,110px) 0}
  .page-hero h1{margin-top:16px}
  .lead{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:var(--fs-h3);line-height:1.35}
  .pull-quote{
    font-family:var(--serif);font-size:var(--fs-h3);color:var(--copper);
    line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    margin:1.4em 0;padding-left:20px;border-left:3px solid var(--amber);
  }
  .voice h2{color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:16px}
  .voice p{color:var(--stone-light);margin-bottom:1em}
  .banner-sec{padding-bottom:0}
  .banner-sec img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .next{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .next h2{margin-bottom:8px}
  .next-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
</style>
